>Oasis of Morality</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Named_item_sets#Oasis_of_Morality\" title=\"Named item sets\">Oasis of Morality</a>:</b> 2 Pieces Equipped:<br />+2% Artifact bonus to Positive Spellcrit Chance<br />+10 Artifact bonus to Positive Spellpower<br />+5% Artifact bonus to Fortification Bypass</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Named_item_sets#Vulkoor&#39;s_Chosen\" title=\"Named item sets\">Vulkoor's Chosen</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Named_item_sets#Vulkoor&#39;s_Chosen\" title=\"Named item sets\">Vulkoor's Chosen</a>:</b> 2 Pieces Equipped:<br />+10 Artifact bonus to Poison Resistance<br />+1 Artifact bonus to Sneak Attack Dice<br />+1 Artifact bonus to Saving Throws<br />+1 Artifact bonus to Dexterity and Constitution</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Named_item_sets#Windlasher&#39;s_Ferocity\" title=\"Named item sets\">Windlasher's Ferocity</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Named_item_sets#Windlasher&#39;s_Ferocity\" title=\"Named item sets\">Windlasher's Ferocity</a>:</b> 2 Pieces Equipped:<br />+5% Artifact bonus to Doublestrike and Doubleshot<br />+5 Artifact bonus to Melee and Ranged Power</span></span></li></ul>\n</ul></div>\n</div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1; vertical-align: middle;\" rowspan=\"4\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Gem_of_Many_Facets.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Gem_of_Many_Facets.png/420px-Gem_of_Many_Facets.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"566\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Gem_of_Many_Facets.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\"><a href=\"/page/Epic_Crafting\" title=\"Epic Crafting\">Epic Crafting</a> to <a href=\"/page/Item:Epic_Gem_of_Many_Facets\" title=\"Item:Epic Gem of Many Facets\">Epic Gem of Many Facets</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\"><i>From this chain hangs a gem that is very finely cut, giving it countless glittering faces. It can take the place of various other items for the purpose of activating certain set bonuses.<br /><br />This item will randomly choose from available set bonuses whenever it is re-acquired or upgraded to a higher level version. This item is also keyed for Essence Crafting, and may be Disjuncted so that it can be crafted upon. Note that upgrading this item to a higher level version through Epic or Legendary Crafting will destroy what has been crafted upon it, and will also re-roll available set bonuses.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\">\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p>\n<ul><li><span style=\"background-color: initial; color: #FF0000;\"><span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: inherit;\"><i>This item cannot be fed to <a href=\"/page/Sentient_Weapon\" title=\"Sentient Weapon\">sentient jewels</a>.</i></span></span></li>\n<li>Note that although the gem itself is ML 5, the items it helps create sets with vary up to ML 11. Plan your gear around those items, not this one.</li></ul>\n<ul><li>The description about \"re-acquiring\" the Gem is misleading; it means that each new Gem will have a different pair of sets.</li>\n<li>Unlike the <a href=\"/page/Item:Epic_Gem_of_Many_Facets\" title=\"Item:Epic Gem of Many Facets\">epic version</a>, you cannot re-select the set bonuses at an altar.</li></ul>\n<p><b>Warning</b>: Don't trust the preview window in the <a href=\"/page/Altar_of_Epic_Rituals\" title=\"Altar of Epic Rituals\">Altar of Epic Rituals</a>! When you place the item into the altar, the preview window shows a random pair of set bonuses. However, when you do upgrade the item, you will get a different random pair.\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260816151921\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.137 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.191 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 12390/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 88048/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 50451/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 32/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 4051/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 13/150\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%  158.780      1 Template:Named_item\n100.00%  158.780      1 -total\n 98.39%  156.219      1 Template:Named_Jewelry\n 88.54%  140.578    131 Template:IO\n 29.07%   46.153     26 Template:Popup\n 27.00%   42.876      2 